{
  "schema": "fcb.design-plan/1",
  "spec_id": "g3-dev-015-ribbed-pad",
  "spec_text": "A stiffened pad: a 60 mm by 40 mm base plate 5 mm thick with a single vertical rib standing on the base's long centreline. The rib is 60 mm long, 6 mm thick and rises 20 mm above the base.",
